"The camera could not resume. The active scan remains open; return to the app to retry or use Stop to save it." = "相机未能恢复。当前扫描仍保持打开；请重新进入应用重试，或点击终止按钮保存。";
"Continuous streaming is always enabled: old working-memory nodes are written to one on-disk database without stopping ARKit. Map optimization and generation run on the PC." = "连续流式扫描始终启用：旧工作内存节点会写入同一个磁盘数据库，不会停止 ARKit；地图优化和生成在 PC 端执行。";
"Software error optimization is enabled. Unstable tracking frames and implausible pose jumps are excluded; AprilTag and landmark priors are not used." = "纯软件误差优化已启用：不稳定 tracking 帧和不可能的位姿跳变不会进入地图；当前不使用 AprilTag 或地标先验。";
"Memory pressure detected. Older frames remain on disk; live preview was reduced without stopping the scan." = "检测到内存压力。旧扫描帧仍保存在磁盘中，系统已降低实时预览开销，扫描不会中断。";
"\nStructure coverage: %d stable / %d multi-view (%d%%)" = "\n结构覆盖：%d 个稳定栅格 / %d 个多视角栅格（%d%%）";
"Depth is temporarily unavailable. Point the camera at the aisle floor and shelf base." = "暂时没有可用深度。请将镜头对准通道地面和货架底座。";
"Floor reference is incomplete. Tilt the camera slightly downward while keeping the shelf base visible." = "地面参照不足。请在保持货架底座可见的同时，将镜头略微向下。";
"Reliable depth is sparse. Move closer and avoid reflective packaging filling the view." = "可靠深度点较少。请适当靠近，并避免让反光包装占满画面。";
"Shelf structure is visible, but floor context is weak. Tilt slightly downward without losing the shelf base." = "已经看到货架结构，但地面参照不足。请稍微向下调整镜头，同时保留货架底座。";
"New shelf structure detected. Move slowly for a second observation." = "检测到新的货架结构。请放慢移动，以获得第二次观测。";
"This shelf is mostly single-view. Shift the viewing angle gradually while keeping the aisle floor visible." = "该货架目前主要是单视角证据。请在保持通道地面可见的同时，缓慢改变观察角度。";
"Reliable loop closure has been missing for a long distance. Return through the nearest previously scanned cross-aisle before continuing." = "较长距离内没有可靠闭环。请先经过最近已扫描的横向主通道返回，再继续扫描。";
"The iPhone is warming up. Live rendering was reduced while structural capture remains active." = "iPhone 正在升温。系统已降低实时渲染开销，结构采集仍保持运行。";
"Streaming working-memory nodes" = "流式工作内存节点数";
